# =============================================================
# Arktoria Goods Text Icons (placeholder sizes & textures)
# size = { 25 25 } per request; offset standardized { 0 7 }; fontsize 18
# Replace texture paths with actual dds icons when available.
# Suggested final path convention:
#   gfx/interface/icons/goods/<good>.dds  (you can batch export)
# =============================================================

# Helper note: If a texture is missing, the engine will show a pink/black square.
# You can progressively replace placeholder textures without changing this file.

